{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35853","headline":"送李尊师归临川 · 李咸用","name":"送李尊师归临川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蟠桃一别几千春，谪下人间作至人。\n尘外烟霞吟不尽，鼎中龙虎伏初驯。\n除存紫府无他意，终向青冥举此身。\n辞我麻姑山畔去，蔡经踪迹必相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}